    "title": "Shenyang students read aloud to honor returning remains of martyrs - Chinadaily.com.cn",
    "text": "Students from Northeast Yucai School in Shenyang, Liaoning province, read The Most Lovable People aloud ahead of the 31st World Book and Copyright Day, which falls on Thursday. [Photo provided to chinadaily.com.cn] Ahead of the 31st World Book and Copyright Day on April 23, several schools in Shenyang, Liaoning province, organized read-aloud sessions covering a textbook article titled The Most Lovable People to coincide with the burial ceremony for the 13th set of remains of Chinese soldiers who died during the War to Resist US Aggression and Aid Korea (1950-53).",
